          "description": "A History Podcast for Kids! Parents love us, Teachers love us, and most importantly, kids do too!\nHistory can be amazing, inspiring and relevant to anyone.  We love to share the stories of Spies, funny foods, George Washington's foibles, early advancements in cartooning and ballooning and much more! A professional music score and important songs accompany nearly every themed episode.  Proud Kids Listen Member @pastandcurious",
